-- Gilneas, They Have Allies, But So Do We (24681), the last quest of chapter two before Endgame:
--  * It needs 8 Wolfmaw Outriders (37938), but only 3 stand in phase 189, with a respawn time of two hours, so the
--    quest took hours. Legends of Azeroth 5.4.8 has 23 in the same phase (mask 1048576, the 189 window) with a 60 second
--    respawn and a wander distance of 3 yards, in three packs of 5 to 8 and four single ones. Add them with the guids 9390100 to
--    9390122 (one per Legends of Azeroth guid, in guid order); the three existing ones stay.
--  * The quest is done with the Night Elven Glaive Throwers (38150), which stand in phase 188 only, so they are
--    gone once the quest is offered in 189. Legends of Azeroth has them in 188, 189 and 191 (mask 5767168); group 503
--    of the client's PhaseXPhaseGroup table is 188, 189, 191 and 192, and nothing stands in 192.
-- Based on Legends of Azeroth 5.4.8.

DELETE FROM `creature` WHERE `guid` BETWEEN 9390100 AND 9390122;

UPDATE `creature` SET `phaseId` = 0, `phaseGroup` = 503 WHERE `map` = 654 AND `id` = 38150 AND `guid` IN (234104, 234106);
